msgid "Chapter Quiz: %1"
msgstr "Kapitel-Quiz: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:804
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quiz on Chapter End"
msgstr "Quiz am Kapitelende"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:807
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Offer a comprehension quiz when you finish reading a chapter. Requires a "
"book with a table of contents."
msgstr ""
"Ein Verständnisquiz anbieten, wenn ein Kapitel zu Ende gelesen wurde. "
"Erfordert ein Buch mit einem Inhaltsverzeichnis."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:812
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quiz Chapter Level"
msgstr "Kapitel-Quiz-Ebene"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:822
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Which TOC level counts as a 'chapter' for end-of-chapter quizzes. A fixed "
"level falls back to the deepest level the book actually has. 'Auto-detect' "
"picks the deepest level whose chapters are at least the minimum length "
"below. 'All TOC headings' follows KOReader's TOC tick settings. Short or "
"skimmed chapters are skipped by the length setting below."
msgstr ""
"Welche Inhaltsverzeichnis-Ebene als „Kapitel“ für Kapitelende-Quizze gilt. "
"Eine feste Ebene fällt auf die tiefste Ebene zurück, die das Buch "
"tatsächlich aufweist. „Automatisch erkennen“ wählt die tiefste Ebene, deren "
"Kapitel mindestens die unten angegebene Mindestlänge haben. „Alle "
"Inhaltsverzeichnis-Überschriften“ folgt den Inhaltsverzeichnis-Tick-"
"Einstellungen von KOReader. Kurze oder übersprungene Kapitel werden durch "
"die unten stehende Längeneinstellung übersprungen."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:828
#, fuzzy
msgid "Minimum Chapter Length (pages)"
msgstr "Minimale Kapitellänge (Seiten)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:835
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Skip the chapter-end quiz for chapters shorter than this many pages (0 = no "
"minimum). Also sets the threshold 'Auto-detect' uses to pick the chapter "
"level. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr ""
"Das Kapitelende-Quiz für Kapitel überspringen, die kürzer als diese "
"Seitenanzahl sind (0 = kein Minimum). Legt auch den Schwellenwert fest, den "
"„Automatisch erkennen“ zur Auswahl der Kapitel-Ebene verwendet. Kann pro "
"Buch in den Bucheinstellungen überschrieben werden."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:841
#, fuzzy
msgid "Minimum Reading Time (minutes)"
msgstr "Mindestlesezeit (Minuten)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:848
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Skip the chapter-end quiz unless you spent at least this many minutes "
"reading the chapter (0 = no minimum). Catches flipping quickly through a "
"long chapter. Uses KOReader's reading statistics; if those are unavailable "
"the quiz is still offered. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr ""
"Überspringe das Kapitel-Abschlussquiz, es sei denn, du hast mindestens diese "
"Anzahl von Minuten das Kapitel gelesen (0 = kein Minimum). Erkennt schnelles "
"Durchblättern eines langen Kapitels. Verwendet KOReaders Lesestatistiken; "
"falls diese nicht verfügbar sind, wird das Quiz trotzdem angeboten. Kann pro "
"Buch in den Bucheinstellungen überschrieben werden."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:854
#, fuzzy
msgid "Question Count"
msgstr "Fragenanzahl"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:861
#, fuzzy
msgid "Total number of questions to generate per quiz."
msgstr "Gesamtanzahl der pro Quiz zu generierenden Fragen."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:866
#, fuzzy
msgid "Difficulty"
msgstr "Schwierigkeitsgrad"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:874
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Easy: straightforward recall. Medium: comprehension and application. Hard: "
"analysis and synthesis."
msgstr ""
"Einfach: direktes Erinnern. Mittel: Verständnis und Anwendung. Schwer: "
"Analyse und Synthese."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:879
#, fuzzy
msgid "Include Multiple Choice"
msgstr "Multiple-Choice einbeziehen"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:886
#, fuzzy
msgid "Include Short Answer"
msgstr "Kurzantworten einbeziehen"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:893
#, fuzzy
msgid "Include Discussion"
msgstr "Diskussion einbeziehen"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:909
#, fuzzy
msgid "Automatic X-Ray (all books)"
msgstr "Automatisches X-Ray (alle Bücher)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:912
msgid ""
"Keep the X-Rays you started up to date as you read (flowing formats like "
"EPUB only): checkpoints at chapter-sized steps, always keeping the next "
"checkpoint ready ahead of you; reaching it installs it instantly and the one "
"after starts building. Books with no X-Ray are left alone: start one from "
"the X-Ray popup with \"In checkpoints, as I read (automatic)\", or switch a "
"book to Automatic individually (X-Ray popup or Book Settings → Automatic X-"
"Ray), which works even with this off; a per-book Off always wins.\n"
"\n"
"Spend guards: a cooldown before retrying a step that was declined, failed or "
"cancelled, WiFi only, and text-extraction consent (or a trusted provider) "
"required; background runs extract book text and use API tokens without a per-"
"request tap. Leave off if every request should be explicit."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:938
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cooldown (minutes)"
msgstr "Abklingzeit (Minuten)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:945
msgid ""
"Minimum wait before retrying an automatic checkpoint after one was declined, "
"failed or cancelled (0 = no cooldown). A completed build does not wait."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:951
#, fuzzy
msgid "Notify on Background Activity"
msgstr "Bei Hintergrundaktivität benachrichtigen"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:954
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Show a brief notification when a background X-Ray update or create starts "
"and completes, and when a checkpoint is silently swapped in. Off = fully "
"silent (the X-Ray popup always shows the current coverage)."
msgstr ""
"Eine kurze Benachrichtigung anzeigen, wenn ein Hintergrund-Update oder eine "
"Erstellung des X-Ray beginnt und abgeschlossen wird, sowie wenn ein "
"Checkpoint still eingesetzt wird. Aus = vollständig lautlos (das X-Ray-Popup "
"zeigt stets die aktuelle Abdeckung)."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:960
#, fuzzy
msgid "Checkpoints at Chapter Ends"
msgstr "Checkpoints an Kapitelenden"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:963
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When building X-Ray checkpoints, place each checkpoint at the nearest "
"chapter end (within a few percent) instead of an exact percentage; "
"checkpoints then read as \"up to the end of a chapter\", and the versions "
"list shows the chapter names. Needs a table of contents. Checkpoint spacing "
"itself adapts to book length: about every 10% of a normal-length book, "
"larger steps for short ones."
msgstr ""
"Beim Erstellen von X-Ray-Checkpoints jeden Checkpoint an das nächstgelegene "
"Kapitelende (innerhalb weniger Prozent) setzen statt an einen exakten "
"Prozentwert; Checkpoints lesen sich dann als „bis zum Ende eines Kapitels“, "
"und die Versionsliste zeigt die Kapitelnamen. Erfordert ein "
"Inhaltsverzeichnis. Der Checkpoint-Abstand selbst passt sich der Buchlänge "
"an: etwa alle 10 % bei normal langen Büchern, größere Schritte bei kurzen."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:968
#, fuzzy
msgid "Categories for New X-Rays"
msgstr "Kategorien für neue X-Rays"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:971
msgid ""
"Which category groups a new X-Ray tracks by default: everything, or a "
"narrower preset such as Reference (no timeline) or Characters only. Applies "
"when an X-Ray is created or rebuilt; individual books can pick their own "
"categories in Book Settings."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:976
msgid "Depth of New X-Rays"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:979
msgid ""
"How much each X-Ray entry carries by default. Light: one line per entry, "
"only recurring figures and turning points, about half the cost. Standard: a "
"few sentences per entry, everything the reader meets. Deep: longer entries, "
"every figure and development, richer connections. Applies when an X-Ray is "
"created or rebuilt; checkpoints and updates keep the depth the X-Ray was "
"started with. Individual books can pick their own depth in Book Settings."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:984
#, fuzzy
msgid "X-Ray Entry for Matching Selections"
msgstr "X-Ray-Eintrag bei übereinstimmender Auswahl"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:987
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When a tapped word or selected text exactly matches an X-Ray entity's name "
"or alias, open that X-Ray entry directly — skipping ahead of the dictionary "
"and the highlight menu (including any bypass actions you have set there). "
"Anything that doesn't match falls through to your normal dictionary/"
"highlight behavior. Only does anything for books that have an X-Ray. A very "
"long press at the end of a selection always shows the normal highlight menu."
msgstr ""
"Wenn ein angetipptes Wort oder markierter Text genau dem Namen oder Alias "
"einer X-Ray-Entität entspricht, direkt diesen X-Ray-Eintrag öffnen — unter "
"Umgehung des Wörterbuchs und des Highlight-Menüs (einschließlich etwaiger "
"dort eingerichteter Umgehungsaktionen). Alles, was nicht übereinstimmt, "
"fällt durch zu Ihrem normalen Wörterbuch-/Highlight-Verhalten. Wirkt nur bei "
"Büchern mit einem X-Ray. Ein sehr langer Druck am Ende einer Auswahl zeigt "
"immer das normale Highlight-Menü."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1005
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Discreetly underline words on the page that match an X-Ray entity's name or "
"alias, as you read (dotted gray, drawn shortly after the page settles; "
"entirely on-device). Tap a marked word to open its entry. Only active for "
"books that have an X-Ray. EPUB page mode only."
msgstr ""
"Unauffälliges Unterstreichen von Wörtern auf der Seite, die dem Namen oder "
"Alias einer X-Ray-Entität entsprechen, während Sie lesen (gepunktet grau, "
"kurz nach dem Einpendeln der Seite gezeichnet; vollständig auf dem Gerät). "
"Ein markiertes Wort antippen, um dessen Eintrag zu öffnen. Nur aktiv bei "
"Büchern mit einem X-Ray. Nur im EPUB-Seitenmodus."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1018
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tap Marked Words to Open"
msgstr "Markierte Wörter zum Öffnen antippen"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1021
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With passive marking on, a plain tap on a marked word opens its X-Ray entry, "
"like a link (real links in the text still win). Off = marks are visual only; "
